{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20997","headline":"江南弄 · 李贺","name":"江南弄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江中绿雾起凉波，天上叠巘红嵯峨。\n水风浦云生老竹，渚暝蒲帆如一幅。\n鲈鱼千头酒百斛，酒中倒卧南山绿。\n吴歈越吟未终曲，江上团团帖寒玉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}